OL,3,CHeathrow Airport warns passengers not
OL,4,Cto travel by road after flooding
OL,6,FHeathrow Airport has warned passengers
OL,7,Fagainst travelling to Terminals 2 and
OL,8,F3 by road after flooding.
OL,10,FRoad access is blocked in those areas
OL,11,Fafter the airport's central terminal
OL,12,Farea was flooded, forcing ongoing road
OL,13,Fclosures, it said.
OL,15,FPeople have been asked to leave extra
OL,16,Ftime to complete their journeys and to
OL,17,Fuse the Heathrow Express, Elizabeth
OL,18,FLine, and Piccadilly Line, or park-and-
OL,19,Fride services at Terminals Four and
OL,20,FFive.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
