OL,3,CHeathrow Airport warns passengers not
OL,4,Cto travel by road after flooding
OL,6,FThe disruption has hit passengers amid
OL,7,Fthe school summer holidays, which see
OL,8,Fhundreds of thousands of customers
OL,9,Fpass through the airport at peak times.
OL,11,FA statement on Heathrow Airport's
OL,12,Fwebsite said: "Flooding in the central
OL,13,Fterminal area has resulted in ongoing
OL,14,Froad closures restricting access to
OL,15,FTerminals 2 and 3.
OL,17,F"Passengers travelling to or from
OL,18,Feither of these terminals today must
OL,19,Fnot travel by road.
OL,26,@tD@OOUyD@AOU
